# Cursor AI Rule — Greenhouse Automation (PyQt5 + Express.js + RabbitMQ + Redis)

**Filename:** `greenhouse_cursor_rules.mdc`

**Context:** Desktop app: PyQt5 (UI, local fog/cache edge). Backend: Express.js (API, cache coordinator). Messaging: RabbitMQ. Caching: Redis (central + local edge caches). Edge-to-edge fog data aggregation with clear separation of responsibilities.

